  "title": "Slow Cooker Mexican Beef Stew",
  "description": "This Mexican beef stew with black beans, tomatoes, corn, and chili powder is easy to make in a slow cooker for a hearty, south-of-the-border stew.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
  ],
